vitrum carries two vendored forks that are other projects' work, kept under
their own upstream copyright and their own MIT license:

  vendor-pty/  a fork of portable-pty
               Copyright (c) 2018 Wez Furlong
               MIT license, in vendor-pty/LICENSE.md

  vendor-ghostty-vt-sys/
               a fork of libghostty-vt-sys
               MIT license, as declared by upstream's package metadata and
               carried unchanged in vendor-ghostty-vt-sys/Cargo.toml

Those trees are not relicensed by anything in this repository.

To contribute, see CONTRIBUTING.md.
